      'The Court of the Lions — a court with an arcade of slender paired columns, two pavilions, and a fountain held on twelve lions.',
      'The Partal — a pavilion with a portico and a pool on the north wall, east of the palaces.',
      'The Rauda — a royal garden and burial ground beside the Palace of the Lions.',
      'The Albaicín — the white houses with patios climbing the hill across the Darro.',
