      'The Piazza della Signoria — the square with the Palazzo della Signoria and its tower 94 m high, and the Loggia dei Lanzi.',
      'The Palazzo Medici — the Medici family\'s palace on the Via Larga, in rusticated stone, with a corner loggia.',
      'The Mercato Vecchio and Santa Maria Novella — the old market with its column of Abundance, and the church with its front of coloured marble on its piazza.',
